    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91527" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυξ-ίον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tablet of box-wood</i> for
